      "doi": "10.14288/1.0101866",
      "title": "Romanticism and the \"dissociation of sensibility\"; a study of Charles Baudelaire and T.S. Eliot",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Angelika Maria Maeser",
          "openalex_id": "A5084136450"
